---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About Us" description="About MegaTools Hub">
	<div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto py-12 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
		<h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-8">About MegaTools</h1>
		<div class="prose prose-lg dark:prose-invert">
			<p>MegaTools Hub is a professional platform dedicated to providing developers, system administrators, and IT professionals with fast, secure, and reliable utilities.</p>
			<p>All our core tools run 100% on the client side (in your browser), ensuring that your sensitive data—such as source code, JWT tokens, and internal IPs—never leaves your device.</p>
			<p><strong>Mission:</strong> To eliminate the need to search the web for broken, ad-filled, or unsafe tools by providing a unified, privacy-first ecosystem.</p>
		</div>
	</div>
</Layout>
